                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Emitumbi yaabo ku erirambirirana ahagati y'ebishushani byabo ebirikuramibwa, n'okwehinguririza amatambiro gaabo, aha mitwe y'ebibungo byona n'enshozi zoona, ahansi y'ekiti kyona ekibisi ekyetwa omurinzi, n'ahansi y'omwela gwona oguyumbize, ahu baabaire bootererera ebishushani byabo ebirikuramibwa emigaju erikutaamirana, obwo nibwo barimanya ku ndi MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.6.13"
            ]
          }
