        {
          "text": " Ndyababangira omukono, ensi ngihindure amatongo, n'ahatarikutuurwa, ahu baabaire batwire hoona, okuruga omu ihamba okuhika Ribula. Obwo nibwo barimanya ku ndi MUKAMA.",
          "type": "text",
